        "TileImage": "$($repository 246c1a0b-5ce5-4125-808c-8d38e364b407).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning 47. Your Target is Hans Graub. Hans Graub is the Cheif security officer of the Himmipan Luxury Hotel resort in Bangkok Thailand. It was recently discovered that Graub had been taking breaks to early and for an extended period of time. This is strictly forbiden, and must be taken care of immediately. Hans Graub roams the halls of the basement under the Hotel. Do with that information as you will.\r\rI will Leave you to prepare. Good luck 47.",
